  <metadata>
    <id>UiPath.OmniPage.Activities</id>
    <version>1.1.0</version>
    <title>UiPath.OmniPage.Activities</title>
    <authors>UiPath</authors>
    <owners>UiPath</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://www.uipath.com/hubfs/legalspot/UiPath_EULA.pdf</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://activities.uipath.com/docs/about-the-omnipageocr-activities-pack</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://download.uipath.com/logo.ico</iconUrl>
    <description>The UiPath OmniPage Activities pack contains the OmniPage OCR activity, using the Nuance OmniPage OCR Engine.
Powered by OmniPage OCR.
NuanceTM OCR © 2019 Nuance Communications. All Rights Reserved.</description>
    <releaseNotes>New Features and Improvements

* Three new languages, German (DE), South Korean (KO), and Portuguese (PT-BR) are available for the **UiPath.OmniPageOCR.Activities** package.

Bug Fixes

* Fixed an issue that caused an incorrect character rotation when the **Digitize Document** activity was using the **OmniPage OCR**. Now, the rotation is always taken into consideration.


For the complete release notes, please visit https://activities.uipath.com/docs/release-notes-omnipageocr.</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="UiPath.OCR.Contracts" version="2.1.0" />
      <dependency id="UiPath.OmniPage.Bundle" version="1.0.1" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>